---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="FIAP & NPAS Distinctions"
  description="Apply online for prestigious NPAS distinctions (LNPAS, ANPAS, FNPAS) and FIAP distinctions (AFIAP, EFIAP, MFIAP) through the National Photographic Art Society of Sri Lanka."
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="bg-neutral-900/60 border-b border-neutral-800 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400">Artistic Honors & Recognition</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">International & National Distinctions</h1>
      <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-neutral-400 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed px-4">
        As the authorized Operational Member for FIAP in Sri Lanka, NPAS facilitates global honors and confers prestigious national qualifications.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Notice Alert on FIAP Regulations -->
  <section class="bg-amber-500/10 border-b border-amber-500/20 py-6">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-200">
      <span class="text-2xl">⚠️</span>
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Mandatory FIAP Regulation:</strong> Applying for FIAP distinctions through a society other than that of your own country is strictly against FIAP rules. <strong>All Sri Lankan photographers must apply for FIAP Honors exclusively through NPAS.</strong> The annual application closing date is <strong>31st July</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Distinctions Overview Grid -->
  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-neutral-950">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-20">
      
      <!-- Section 1: NPAS Distinctions with Direct Application Links -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-6 sm:p-12 space-y-10 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 border-b border-neutral-800 pb-8">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400">National Honors Framework</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mt-1">NPAS Distinctions</h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-400 mt-2">
              Evaluated and awarded annually by the Board of Distinctions of the National Photographic Art Society.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <a
              href="/assets/docs/distinctions/Distinctions_Details_Revised_2022.pdf"
              target="_blank"
              class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-700 text-white text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 border border-neutral-700 transition-all"
            >
              📄 Download Regulations (PDF)
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Distinction Levels with Direct Online Application Google Forms -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          
          <!-- LNPAS -->
          <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all">
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase">Level 1</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">LNPAS</h3>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400">Licentiate of NPAS</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
                Demonstrates competence in fundamental photography, sharp focusing, balanced exposure, and composition across selected genres.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a
              href="https://forms.gle/GyHE7MXKAubvsQqc7"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-neutral-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-center transition-all shadow-md"
            >
              Apply for LNPAS &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- ANPAS -->
          <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all">
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase">Level 2</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">ANPAS</h3>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400">Associate of NPAS</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
                Requires advanced visual artistry, personal style, creative interpretation, and a high standard of craftsmanship.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a
              href="https://forms.gle/qkSKT6sgWgSB5ZF37"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-neutral-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-center transition-all shadow-md"
            >
              Apply for ANPAS &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>

          <!-- FNPAS -->
          <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all">
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded bg-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase">Highest Honor</span>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">FNPAS</h3>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-400">Fellowship of NPAS</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
                The highest distinguished honor awarded for distinguished mastery, individual creative vision, and leadership in photographic art.
              </p>
            </div>
            <a
              href="https://forms.gle/QeDxyomyxh3SNBds5"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block w-full py-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-neutral-950 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-center transition-all shadow-md"
            >
              Apply for FNPAS &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: FIAP Distinctions -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 p-6 sm:p-12 space-y-10 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 border-b border-neutral-800 pb-8">
          <div>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400">Global Federation Honors</span>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mt-1">FIAP Distinctions</h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-400 mt-2">
              Conferred by the Fédération Internationale de l'Art Photographique (FIAP), headquartered in Luxembourg.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex gap-3">
            <a
              href="https://www.myfiap.net/user/register/fp"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-neutral-950 text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-2 transition-all shadow-md"
            >
              Order FIAP Card (myfiap.net) &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FIAP Levels -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-lg">AFIAP</span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Artist FIAP</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
              The first artistic distinction recognizing artistic quality and technique across international salons under FIAP patronage.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-lg">EFIAP</span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Excellence FIAP</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
              Awarded to artists who have achieved a substantial number of awards and acceptances across multiple worldwide countries.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-lg">MFIAP</span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Master FIAP</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
              The pinnacle of photographic artistry, awarded based on a cohesive portfolio of 20 exceptional master photographic prints.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold text-lg">EsFIAP / Hon.EFIAP</span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-white">Service Honors</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
              Conferred upon individuals who have rendered exceptional service to photographic art and the international federation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-neutral-950/60 border border-neutral-800/80 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-xs text-neutral-400">
          <div>
            <strong class="text-white block mb-0.5">FIAP Country Liaison Officer:</strong>
            Sanka Sammana (President, NPAS Sri Lanka) • Email: <a href="mailto:sankasammana@gmail.com" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline">sankasammana@gmail.com</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            Postal: The FIAP Liaison Officer, NPAS Sri Lanka, P.O. Box 452, Colombo.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
